1
00:00:00,346 --> 00:00:02,949
Video ya leo ni nini?

2
00:00:03,276 --> 00:00:06,784
Mazungumzo ya kulinganisha. Upande gani unapendelea?

3
00:00:07,337 --> 00:00:08,837
Sehemu ya 1: Chagua Nguo kwa Ukubwa na Rangi

4
00:00:08,837 --> 00:00:11,470
Tazama hapa.

5
00:00:11,493 --> 00:00:15,326
Shati hili ni zuri sana, sivyo?

6
00:00:15,349 --> 00:00:18,416
Ndiyo, kweli.

7
00:00:18,439 --> 00:00:22,476
Kuna nyekundu na buluu.

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,439
Unapendelea ipi?

9
00:00:25,462 --> 00:00:31,411
Hmm. Mimi napenda buluu zaidi.

10
00:00:31,435 --> 00:00:33,938
Ndiyo hivyo.

11
00:00:33,961 --> 00:00:38,994
Buluu ni kubwa kidogo kuliko nyekundu.

12
00:00:39,017 --> 00:00:41,957
Kweli.

13
00:00:41,981 --> 00:00:45,514
Buluu ni saizi ya L.

14
00:00:45,537 --> 00:00:48,915
Nyekundu ni saizi ya M.

15
00:00:48,938 --> 00:00:52,672
Mimi napendelea saizi ya M.

16
00:00:52,695 --> 00:00:56,928
Basi, nyekundu ni bora zaidi.

17
00:00:56,951 --> 00:01:02,418
Lakini buluu ina rangi nzuri zaidi.

18
00:01:02,441 --> 00:01:04,781
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

19
00:01:04,805 --> 00:01:07,982
Ipi ni rahisi zaidi?

20
00:01:08,005 --> 00:01:11,105
Tutazame bei.

21
00:01:11,128 --> 00:01:15,195
Buluu ni shilingi elfu tatu.

22
00:01:15,218 --> 00:01:18,051
Nyekundu ni bei gani?

23
00:01:18,074 --> 00:01:22,147
Nyekundu ni shilingi elfu mbili na mia tano.

24
00:01:22,171 --> 00:01:26,238
Nyekundu ni rahisi kuliko buluu.

25
00:01:26,261 --> 00:01:30,527
Ndiyo. Lakini nina wasiwasi.

26
00:01:30,550 --> 00:01:35,323
Saki, kwa kawaida huvaa nguo za rangi gani?

27
00:01:35,347 --> 00:01:39,780
Kwa kawaida huvaa nyeusi au nyeupe.

28
00:01:39,803 --> 00:01:44,310
Basi, nyekundu ni rangi angavu na nzuri zaidi.

29
00:01:44,334 --> 00:01:46,568
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

30
00:01:46,591 --> 00:01:50,224
Nyekundu ni rangi ya nguvu.

31
00:01:50,247 --> 00:01:54,187
Ndiyo. Inakufaa sana, nafikiri.

32
00:01:54,210 --> 00:01:59,204
Lakini pia napenda buluu kwa sababu ni rangi ya baridi.

33
00:01:59,227 --> 00:02:02,327
Je, utaijaribu mara moja?

34
00:02:02,350 --> 00:02:05,347
Ndiyo, nitajaribu.

35
00:02:05,371 --> 00:02:08,642
Tutawahi mfanyikazi.

36
00:02:08,666 --> 00:02:12,381
Mfanyikazi yuko pale.

37
00:02:12,404 --> 00:02:17,271
Samahani, naweza kujaribu hii?

38
00:02:17,294 --> 00:02:20,685
Ndiyo, karibu.

39
00:02:20,708 --> 00:02:23,741
Chumba cha kujaribia kiko huko.

40
00:02:23,764 --> 00:02:26,398
Utaivaa ipi?

41
00:02:26,421 --> 00:02:29,988
Kwanza, nitaivaa nyekundu.

42
00:02:30,012 --> 00:02:33,359
Baadae, nitaivaa buluu.

43
00:02:33,382 --> 00:02:35,518
Sawa.

44
00:02:35,541 --> 00:02:39,574
Tutazame ipi inakufaa zaidi.

45
00:02:39,597 --> 00:02:42,067
Asante.

46
00:02:42,091 --> 00:02:45,191
Subiri kidogo.

47
00:02:45,214 --> 00:02:49,047
Ndiyo, usisumbuke.

48
00:02:49,070 --> 00:02:51,570
Ninafurahia.

49
00:02:51,593 --> 00:02:53,093
Sehemu ya 2: Chagua Chakula cha Mchana

50
00:02:53,093 --> 00:02:56,760
Nina njaa.

51
00:02:56,782 --> 00:03:00,816
Ndiyo. Tukale kitu.

52
00:03:00,839 --> 00:03:04,638
Hebu ingia kwenye mgahawa huu.

53
00:03:04,662 --> 00:03:07,395
Sawa.

54
00:03:07,418 --> 00:03:10,576
Tuzame menyu.

55
00:03:10,599 --> 00:03:15,932
Kuna chakula cha mchana cha nyama na cha samaki.

56
00:03:15,955 --> 00:03:19,023
Unapendelea ipi?

57
00:03:19,047 --> 00:03:24,914
Ninapenda zote mbili, nyama na samaki.

58
00:03:24,938 --> 00:03:27,973
Mimi pia.

59
00:03:27,997 --> 00:03:30,540
Inaniuma sana!

60
00:03:30,564 --> 00:03:34,479
Chakula cha mchana cha nyama ni elfu moja yenye.

61
00:03:34,503 --> 00:03:38,936
Cha samaki ni mia nane za shilingi.

62
00:03:38,959 --> 00:03:42,492
Samaki ni rahisi zaidi.

63
00:03:42,515 --> 00:03:47,689
Ndiyo. Lakini nyama ina wingi zaidi.

64
00:03:47,713 --> 00:03:50,083
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

65
00:03:50,106 --> 00:03:54,206
Leo nataka kula kwa wingi.

66
00:03:54,229 --> 00:03:58,096
Je, basi nyama ni bora?

67
00:03:58,119 --> 00:04:03,652
Hmm. Lakini samaki pia inaonekana nzuri.

68
00:04:03,675 --> 00:04:07,951
Mgahawa huu unajulikana kwa samaki yake.

69
00:04:07,974 --> 00:04:11,124
Kweli?

70
00:04:11,147 --> 00:04:15,181
Basi, samaki ni bora.

71
00:04:15,204 --> 00:04:21,917
Kati ya menyu, chakula cha mchana cha samaki ndicho kinachoongoza kwa umaarufu.

72
00:04:21,941 --> 00:04:25,841
Kwa hiyo, mimi nitachagua samaki.

73
00:04:25,864 --> 00:04:28,897
Mimi nitachagua nyama.

74
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:33,513
Jana nilikula samaki nyumbani.

75
00:04:33,536 --> 00:04:36,322
Ndiyo hivyo.

76
00:04:36,346 --> 00:04:40,283
Natumai chakula cha mchana cha nyama kitakuwa kitamu.

77
00:04:40,306 --> 00:04:42,773
Ndiyo.

78
00:04:42,796 --> 00:04:46,764
Aa, tuamkie vinywaji pia.

79
00:04:46,787 --> 00:04:50,367
Kuna kahawa na chai.

80
00:04:50,391 --> 00:04:54,291
Mimi napenda chai baridi.

81
00:04:54,314 --> 00:04:58,467
Kuna chai kwenye menyu pia.

82
00:04:58,490 --> 00:05:01,045
Ni shilingi mia moja.

83
00:05:01,069 --> 00:05:03,735
Sawa sana.

84
00:05:03,758 --> 00:05:06,834
Basi, nitachukua chai.

85
00:05:06,857 --> 00:05:11,174
Mimi nitakunywa kahawa baada ya chakula.

86
00:05:11,198 --> 00:05:13,752
Sawa kabisa.

87
00:05:13,775 --> 00:05:17,809
Je, tuwaita mhudumu?

88
00:05:17,832 --> 00:05:22,023
Samahani, tunaomba chakula.

89
00:05:22,046 --> 00:05:27,523
Tafadhali, chakula cha mchana cha samaki na cha nyama moja-moja.

90
00:05:27,547 --> 00:05:32,980
Pia, chai na kahawa moja-moja.

91
00:05:33,003 --> 00:05:34,503
Sehemu ya 3: Mapendeleo ya Misimu

92
00:05:34,503 --> 00:05:39,437
Leo hali ya hewa ni nzuri sana, sivyo?

93
00:05:39,460 --> 00:05:44,393
Ndiyo, upepo unaonekana mzuri.

94
00:05:44,416 --> 00:05:48,950
Spring ni msimu ninayopenda zaidi.

95
00:05:48,974 --> 00:05:55,607
Kweli? Unapenda zaidi spring kuliko misimu mingine?

96
00:05:55,630 --> 00:06:01,863
Ndiyo. Ni joto na maua yanaonekana mazuri.

97
00:06:01,886 --> 00:06:08,005
Mimi napenda autumn zaidi kuliko spring.

98
00:06:08,029 --> 00:06:10,495
Kwa nini?

99
00:06:10,518 --> 00:06:14,475
Autumn pia ni baridi.

100
00:06:14,499 --> 00:06:18,833
Na chakula kina ladha nzuri.

101
00:06:18,856 --> 00:06:23,766
Kweli. Matunda yana ladha nzuri.

102
00:06:23,790 --> 00:06:28,739
Kati ya summer na winter, unapendelea ipi?

103
00:06:28,763 --> 00:06:34,748
Hmm. Mimi napenda zaidi summer.

104
00:06:34,771 --> 00:06:40,204
Kweli? Lakini summer ni joto mno.

105
00:06:40,227 --> 00:06:45,794
Ndiyo, lakini tunaweza kuogelea baharini.

106
00:06:45,817 --> 00:06:53,550
Napenda zaidi majira ya baridi kuliko majira ya joto. Je, si baridi mno?

107
00:06:53,573 --> 00:06:59,051
Ndiyo, ni baridi, lakini tunaweza kuona theluji.

108
00:06:59,075 --> 00:07:02,263
Theluji ni nzuri sana, sivyo?

109
00:07:02,286 --> 00:07:07,153
Nchini kwangu hakuna theluji.

110
00:07:07,176 --> 00:07:09,843
Kweli?

111
00:07:09,866 --> 00:07:14,904
Mwezi gani wa mwaka ni joto zaidi?

112
00:07:14,927 --> 00:07:19,236
Mwezi wa saba ndio joto zaidi.

113
00:07:19,260 --> 00:07:23,493
Kila siku kuna zaidi ya digrii thelathini.

114
00:07:23,516 --> 00:07:26,830
Hiyo ni ngumu sana.

115
00:07:26,853 --> 00:07:34,605
Ndiyo. Kwa hiyo, majira ya springi nchini Japani ni bora kabisa.

116
00:07:34,629 --> 00:07:36,896
Ni vizuri sana.

117
00:07:36,919 --> 00:07:41,462
Wikendi hii unaenda mahali popote?

118
00:07:41,486 --> 00:07:46,391
Ndiyo, nitaenda bustanini kuona maua ya cherry.

119
00:07:46,414 --> 00:07:48,804
Sawa.

120
00:07:48,827 --> 00:07:51,960
Unaenda na nani?

121
00:07:51,983 --> 00:07:55,131
Nitaenda na marafiki.

122
00:07:55,155 --> 00:07:58,788
Je, utabeba chakula cha mchana?

123
00:07:58,811 --> 00:08:02,847
Ndiyo, nitapika sana.

124
00:08:02,871 --> 00:08:05,538
Inaonekana ya kupendeza.

125
00:08:05,561 --> 00:08:09,241
Nionyeshe picha zilizochukuliwa, tafadhali.

126
00:08:09,264 --> 00:08:13,242
Hakika, nitachukua nyingi.

127
00:08:13,265 --> 00:08:16,175
Insha'Allah itakuwa na hali nzuri ya hewa.

128
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:20,108
Ndiyo, nafikiri itakuwa na jua.

129
00:08:20,131 --> 00:08:21,631
Sehemu ya 4: Jinsi ya Kufika Kwenye Makumbusho ya Sanaa

130
00:08:21,631 --> 00:08:26,998
Haya tutaenda makumbusho ya sanaa siku ya Jumamosi hii.

131
00:08:27,021 --> 00:08:29,487
Sawa.

132
00:08:29,510 --> 00:08:32,882
Tutafika vipi?

133
00:08:32,906 --> 00:08:37,006
Tunaweza kwenda kwa treni au basi.

134
00:08:37,029 --> 00:08:40,129
Nini ni rahisi zaidi?

135
00:08:40,152 --> 00:08:44,618
Treni ni haraka zaidi kuliko basi.

136
00:08:44,641 --> 00:08:47,991
Inachukua dakika ngapi?

137
00:08:48,015 --> 00:08:52,148
Treni inachukua dakika thelathini hivi.

138
00:08:52,171 --> 00:08:55,204
Basi je?

139
00:08:55,227 --> 00:08:59,369
Basi inachukua saa moja.

140
00:08:59,392 --> 00:09:03,626
Treni ni haraka zaidi kabisa.

141
00:09:03,649 --> 00:09:10,115
Ndiyo, lakini basi ni rahisi zaidi kuliko treni.

142
00:09:10,138 --> 00:09:12,572
Ni bei gani?

143
00:09:12,595 --> 00:09:16,261
Basi ni shilingi mia mbili.

144
00:09:16,284 --> 00:09:19,518
Treni ni shilingi mia tano.

145
00:09:19,541 --> 00:09:23,207
Tofauti ni kubwa.

146
00:09:23,230 --> 00:09:27,068
Ndiyo, unapendelea upi?

147
00:09:27,091 --> 00:09:31,233
Mimi napendelea nini rahisi zaidi.

148
00:09:31,257 --> 00:09:35,336
Haya basi tutaenda kwa basi?

149
00:09:35,359 --> 00:09:39,871
Lakini siku ya Jumamosi barabara huwa na msongamano.

150
00:09:39,894 --> 00:09:42,773
Aa, ndivyo.

151
00:09:42,797 --> 00:09:46,154
Itachukua muda zaidi.

152
00:09:46,178 --> 00:09:51,611
Kwa hiyo, treni inaweza kuwa bora zaidi.

153
00:09:51,634 --> 00:09:53,901
Nimeelewa.

154
00:09:53,924 --> 00:09:57,257
Tutaenda kwa treni.

155
00:09:57,281 --> 00:10:00,714
Tutakutana kwenye kituo cha treni?

156
00:10:00,737 --> 00:10:04,840
Ndiyo, tutaonana saa ngapi?

157
00:10:04,864 --> 00:10:08,781
Makumbusho hufunguliwa saa nne asubuhi.

158
00:10:08,804 --> 00:10:11,571
Saa tatu asubuhi ni vipi?

159
00:10:11,594 --> 00:10:14,433
Sawa tu.

160
00:10:14,457 --> 00:10:18,642
Tukutane saa tatu asubuhi kwenye lango la reli stesheni.

161
00:10:18,665 --> 00:10:22,298
Tutakula chakula cha mchana wapi?

162
00:10:22,321 --> 00:10:27,034
Kuna mgahawa mzuri karibu na makumbusho.

163
00:10:27,058 --> 00:10:31,558
Unapendelea mgahawa au kafe?

164
00:10:31,581 --> 00:10:35,481
Kafe ni bora kwa sababu ni kimya zaidi.

165
00:10:35,504 --> 00:10:37,902
Sawa.

166
00:10:37,926 --> 00:10:40,992
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

167
00:10:41,015 --> 00:10:43,653
Mimi pia.

168
00:10:43,676 --> 00:10:45,176
Sehemu ya 5: Kulinganisha Maisha Tokyo na Vijijini

169
00:10:45,176 --> 00:10:49,310
Maisha Tokyo ni vipi?

170
00:10:49,333 --> 00:10:54,881
Ni ya furaha, lakini watu wengi mno.

171
00:10:54,904 --> 00:10:57,570
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

172
00:10:57,593 --> 00:11:01,565
Kila siku treni zina umma sana.

173
00:11:01,589 --> 00:11:07,540
Mji wangu ni kimya zaidi kuliko Tokyo.

174
00:11:07,564 --> 00:11:10,554
Mji wako ni wa aina gani?

175
00:11:10,578 --> 00:11:15,680
Milima ni safi na hewa ni tamu.

176
00:11:15,703 --> 00:11:18,413
Sawa.

177
00:11:18,437 --> 00:11:23,987
Unapendelea Tokyo au mji wako?

178
00:11:24,010 --> 00:11:26,948
Napenda zote mbili.

179
00:11:26,971 --> 00:11:32,084
Lakini mji wangu unanipa utulivu zaidi.

180
00:11:32,108 --> 00:11:35,642
Ununaji ni vipi?

181
00:11:35,665 --> 00:11:42,617
Tokyo ni bora zaidi kwa urahisi wa ununuzi kuliko mji wangu.

182
00:11:42,641 --> 00:11:46,951
Kuna maduka mengi.

183
00:11:46,974 --> 00:11:49,007
Ndiyo.

184
00:11:49,030 --> 00:11:54,530
Lakini bei za bidhaa Tokyo ni ghali zaidi.

185
00:11:54,553 --> 00:11:59,253
Ninafikiri kodi ya nyumba Tokyo ni ghali zaidi.

186
00:11:59,276 --> 00:12:02,243
Hivi ndivyo kweli.

187
00:12:02,266 --> 00:12:06,366
Kodi ya nyumba mjini kwangu ni rahisi.

188
00:12:06,389 --> 00:12:10,022
Chakula ni vipi?

189
00:12:10,045 --> 00:12:13,479
Chakula kipi ni kitamu zaidi?

190
00:12:13,502 --> 00:12:18,568
Mboga mjini kwangu ni tamu zaidi.

191
00:12:18,591 --> 00:12:21,625
Kwa sababu ni freshi.

192
00:12:21,648 --> 00:12:25,914
Tokyo kuna mikahawa mingi zaidi.

193
00:12:25,937 --> 00:12:28,171
Ndiyo.

194
00:12:28,194 --> 00:12:33,028
Unaweza kula vyakula vya mataifa mbalimbali.

195
00:12:33,051 --> 00:12:37,084
Hiyo ni mojawapo ya sifa za Tokyo.

196
00:12:37,107 --> 00:12:42,808
Wikendi ijayo, je, ungependa kutembelea mji wangu?

197
00:12:42,832 --> 00:12:45,103
Eeh,

198
00:12:45,126 --> 00:12:47,393
Ni sawa?

199
00:12:47,416 --> 00:12:49,649
Ndiyo.

200
00:12:49,672 --> 00:12:54,706
Nitakuelekeza mahali pengi kwa gari.

201
00:12:54,728 --> 00:12:57,228
Ninashukuru sana.

202
00:12:57,251 --> 00:12:59,585
Asante.

203
00:12:59,608 --> 00:13:05,342
Tukae kwenye mgahawa wa ramen ambayo ni bora zaidi mjini.

204
00:13:05,365 --> 00:13:09,319
Ninapenda ramen sana.

205
00:13:09,343 --> 00:13:12,649
Nina hakika utapenda.

206
00:13:12,673 --> 00:13:15,908
Kuna maji moto?

207
00:13:15,931 --> 00:13:18,164
Ndiyo.

208
00:13:18,187 --> 00:13:22,820
Kuna maji moto mazuri karibu na milima.

209
00:13:22,843 --> 00:13:25,743
Ninafurahia.

210
00:13:25,766 --> 00:13:28,433
Natamani kwenda mapema.

211
00:13:28,456 --> 00:13:33,013
Basi, tukutane wikendi hii.

212
00:13:33,036 --> 00:13:34,903
Ndiyo.

213
00:13:34,926 --> 00:13:37,870
Asante kwa msaada wako.

214
00:13:37,893 --> 00:13:39,393
Sehemu ya 6: Uchaguzi Bora wa Matunda

215
00:13:39,393 --> 00:13:42,141
Karibu.

216
00:13:42,164 --> 00:13:45,274
Ungependa matunda?

217
00:13:45,298 --> 00:13:50,398
Matunda ya supermarket ni freshi sana.

218
00:13:50,421 --> 00:13:52,454
Ndiyo.

219
00:13:52,477 --> 00:13:57,510
Leo, tufaa kama matunda ya apple na machungwa zina bei nafuu.

220
00:13:57,533 --> 00:14:02,479
Kati ya apple na machungwa, ipi linakuwa tamu zaidi?

221
00:14:02,503 --> 00:14:07,742
Wakati huu wa mwaka, machungwa yanakuwa matamu zaidi.

222
00:14:07,765 --> 00:14:10,341
Ndiyo hivyo.

223
00:14:10,364 --> 00:14:13,598
Apple je, vipi?

224
00:14:13,622 --> 00:14:18,888
Apple ina kidogo cha uchungu, lakini ni tamu.

225
00:14:18,911 --> 00:14:22,485
Nitachagua ipi sasa?

226
00:14:22,509 --> 00:14:26,046
Kuna majaribio ya kula.

227
00:14:26,069 --> 00:14:28,536
Jaribu kula basi.

228
00:14:28,559 --> 00:14:31,066
Asante.

229
00:14:31,089 --> 00:14:34,956
Kwanza nitakula apple.

230
00:14:34,979 --> 00:14:37,158
Inakuwaje?

231
00:14:37,181 --> 00:14:41,491
Ina ladha nzuri na ni tamu, pia ina hali ya kuvunja kwa sauti.

232
00:14:41,515 --> 00:14:45,615
Sasa jaribu machungwa pia.

233
00:14:45,638 --> 00:14:47,753
Ndiyo.

234
00:14:47,776 --> 00:14:52,013
Aa, machungwa yanakuwa matamu zaidi.

235
00:14:52,037 --> 00:14:54,504
Ndiyo hiyo.

236
00:14:54,527 --> 00:14:59,793
Kati ya machungwa haya, hii ndiyo aina tamu zaidi.

237
00:14:59,816 --> 00:15:05,883
Zote mbili ni tamu, lakini mimi napenda machungwa zaidi.

238
00:15:05,906 --> 00:15:09,873
Ungependa kununua machungwa mangapi?

239
00:15:09,896 --> 00:15:14,367
Familia yangu pia itakula, kwa hivyo nataka nyingi.

240
00:15:14,390 --> 00:15:17,940
Kifurushi hiki kina machungwa kumi.

241
00:15:17,963 --> 00:15:20,663
Nitakichukua hicho.

242
00:15:20,686 --> 00:15:23,123
Ni bei gani?

243
00:15:23,146 --> 00:15:26,079
Shilingi mia tano.

244
00:15:26,102 --> 00:15:29,059
Una ndizi pia?

245
00:15:29,082 --> 00:15:31,049
Ndiyo.

246
00:15:31,073 --> 00:15:33,458
Zipo huko.

247
00:15:33,482 --> 00:15:38,677
Kati ya matunda, ndizi zina bei nafuu zaidi.

248
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:40,867
Ndiyo.

249
00:15:40,890 --> 00:15:44,271
Zinapendeza kwa kula kila siku.

250
00:15:44,294 --> 00:15:48,481
Basi, nitachukua ndizi pia, kifungu kimoja.

251
00:15:48,504 --> 00:15:51,171
Asante.

252
00:15:51,194 --> 00:15:54,977
Jumla ni shilingi mia saba.

253
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:56,900
Ndiyo.

254
00:15:56,923 --> 00:15:59,623
Nitakupa elfu moja.

255
00:15:59,646 --> 00:16:03,146
Pesa yako ya rudishwa ni shilingi mia tatu.

256
00:16:03,169 --> 00:16:05,737
Asante sana.

257
00:16:05,761 --> 00:16:08,307
Nitakuja tena.

258
00:16:08,330 --> 00:16:11,034
Tutakungoja.

259
00:16:11,058 --> 00:16:12,558
Sehemu ya 7: Michezo Unayopenda na Unayofanya Vizuri

260
00:16:12,558 --> 00:16:18,058
Jumapili uliangalia michezo kwenye televisheni?

261
00:16:18,081 --> 00:16:22,666
Ndiyo, niliangalia mchezo wa kandanda.

262
00:16:22,689 --> 00:16:26,022
Mimi niliona mchezo wa baseball.

263
00:16:26,045 --> 00:16:29,181
Ulikuwa mzuri sana.

264
00:16:29,205 --> 00:16:34,082
Kati ya kandanda na baseball, upi unapenda zaidi?

265
00:16:34,105 --> 00:16:38,338
Mimi napenda baseball zaidi.

266
00:16:38,361 --> 00:16:43,715
Mimi napenda kandanda kuliko baseball.

267
00:16:43,739 --> 00:16:46,272
Kwa nini?

268
00:16:46,295 --> 00:16:52,328
Kwa sababu katika kandanda, watu wanakimbia sana, na hiyo inafanya iwe nzuri.

269
00:16:52,351 --> 00:16:54,658
Nimeelewa.

270
00:16:54,682 --> 00:17:00,015
Kwa baseball, sheria zinaonekana kuwa ngumu kidogo.

271
00:17:00,038 --> 00:17:02,371
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

272
00:17:02,394 --> 00:17:07,261
Mimi sijui sana sheria hizo.

273
00:17:07,284 --> 00:17:11,856
Kati ya michezo, ni ipi unayofanya vizuri zaidi?

274
00:17:11,879 --> 00:17:16,589
Mimi ninacheza tenisi vizuri zaidi.

275
00:17:16,612 --> 00:17:19,193
Tenisi?

276
00:17:19,217 --> 00:17:21,584
Sawa.

277
00:17:21,607 --> 00:17:26,540
Mwishoni mwa wiki, mara nyingi nacheza tenisi kwenye bustani.

278
00:17:26,563 --> 00:17:29,396
Utachagua nani?

279
00:17:29,419 --> 00:17:32,853
Nitakuwa na rafiki wa kazi.

280
00:17:32,876 --> 00:17:35,785
Inaonekana ya kupendeza.

281
00:17:35,808 --> 00:17:39,643
Mimi pia napenda kufanya mazoezi.

282
00:17:39,667 --> 00:17:44,433
Je, siku hizi tutaweza kucheza tenisi pamoja?

283
00:17:44,456 --> 00:17:49,390
Sina ujuzi wa tenisi, je, ni sawa?

284
00:17:49,413 --> 00:17:52,046
Sawa kabisa.

285
00:17:52,069 --> 00:17:55,302
Nitakufundisha polepole.

286
00:17:55,325 --> 00:17:57,625
Asante sana.

287
00:17:57,648 --> 00:18:03,245
Kwa ajili ya mazoezi, ni asubuhi au mchana ipi ni bora?

288
00:18:03,269 --> 00:18:07,624
Asubuhi ni baridi na nzuri zaidi.

289
00:18:07,647 --> 00:18:09,881
Nimeelewa.

290
00:18:09,904 --> 00:18:14,204
Basi, tutacheza asubuhi ya Jumapili.

291
00:18:14,227 --> 00:18:18,293
Je, unahitaji vifaa vya pekee?

292
00:18:18,316 --> 00:18:22,073
Nitakupa raketi na viatu.

293
00:18:22,097 --> 00:18:24,168
Nitasaidiwa sana.

294
00:18:24,191 --> 00:18:27,824
Nitabeba vinywaji.

295
00:18:27,847 --> 00:18:29,921
Asante sana.

296
00:18:29,945 --> 00:18:33,330
Vinywaji vya michezo ni bora.

297
00:18:33,354 --> 00:18:35,824
Nimeelewa.

298
00:18:35,847 --> 00:18:38,280
Nitainunua.

299
00:18:38,303 --> 00:18:41,682
Natumaini siku ya Jumapili itakuwa nzuri.

300
00:18:41,706 --> 00:18:43,972
Ndiyo.

301
00:18:43,995 --> 00:18:46,341
Nitapiga hata kazi.

302
00:18:46,365 --> 00:18:47,865
Mstari wa 8: Wakati wa Chai ya Jioni / Evening Tea Time

303
00:18:47,865 --> 00:18:52,498
Chakula cha jioni kilikuwa kitamu sana, sivyo?

304
00:18:52,521 --> 00:18:57,271
Ndiyo, nimeshiba.

305
00:18:57,294 --> 00:19:00,234
Unataka kunywa kitu?

306
00:19:00,258 --> 00:19:03,358
Nitak zaghisha maji.

307
00:19:03,381 --> 00:19:05,921
Asante sana.

308
00:19:05,945 --> 00:19:10,338
Unapenda kahawa au chai?

309
00:19:10,361 --> 00:19:16,230
Hmm, kwa sababu ni jioni, chai ni bora.

310
00:19:16,253 --> 00:19:20,222
Kama unanywa kahawa, huwezi kulala?

311
00:19:20,246 --> 00:19:25,236
Ndiyo, kahawa ni nzuri zaidi asubuhi.

312
00:19:25,259 --> 00:19:27,367
Nimeelewa.

313
00:19:27,391 --> 00:19:30,059
Nitakupikia chai.

314
00:19:30,082 --> 00:19:34,349
Una sukari na maziwa?

315
00:19:34,372 --> 00:19:37,039
Ndiyo, nina.

316
00:19:37,062 --> 00:19:39,615
Utataka zote mbili?

317
00:19:39,638 --> 00:19:43,622
Nitapenda maziwa tu, tafadhali.

318
00:19:43,646 --> 00:19:46,679
Ndiyo, karibu.

319
00:19:46,702 --> 00:19:50,069
Iko moto, hivi karibu.

320
00:19:50,092 --> 00:19:52,625
Asante.

321
00:19:52,648 --> 00:19:55,548
Inanukia vizuri!

322
00:19:55,572 --> 00:20:00,325
Chai hii nilipokea kama zawadi.

323
00:20:00,349 --> 00:20:03,545
Iliyo toka nchi gani?

324
00:20:03,568 --> 00:20:06,274
Uingereza.

325
00:20:06,297 --> 00:20:10,197
Uingereza ni maarufu kwa chai yake.

326
00:20:10,220 --> 00:20:13,412
Ina ladha nzuri sana.

327
00:20:13,435 --> 00:20:18,469
Inanukia vizuri zaidi kuliko chai ya nchi yangu.

328
00:20:18,492 --> 00:20:20,967
Hiyo ni nzuri.

329
00:20:20,990 --> 00:20:24,094
Nina biskuti pia.

330
00:20:24,118 --> 00:20:27,185
Waa, napenda hiyo!

331
00:20:27,208 --> 00:20:29,508
Nitakula.

332
00:20:29,531 --> 00:20:34,441
Kati ya vinywaji, unapenda nini zaidi?

333
00:20:34,464 --> 00:20:38,797
Napenda chai zaidi ya vyote.

334
00:20:38,820 --> 00:20:41,854
Je, ni chai ya kijapani ya kijani?

335
00:20:41,877 --> 00:20:47,543
Ndiyo, chai ya kijani na vitamu vya asali hupendana sana.

336
00:20:47,566 --> 00:20:49,718
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

337
00:20:49,742 --> 00:20:53,575
Mimi pia napenda sana chai ya kijani.

338
00:20:53,598 --> 00:20:58,232
Je, tutaenda dukani ya chai tamu siku hizi?

339
00:20:58,255 --> 00:21:01,155
Sawa.

340
00:21:01,178 --> 00:21:05,244
Kuna duka jipya karibu na kituo cha treni.

341
00:21:05,267 --> 00:21:07,901
Tutakwenda lini?

342
00:21:07,924 --> 00:21:11,492
Je, Jumamosi ya wiki hii inafaa?

343
00:21:11,515 --> 00:21:14,790
Ndio, nina muda.

344
00:21:14,814 --> 00:21:17,281
Twende basi.

345
00:21:17,304 --> 00:21:19,937
Ninangoja kwa hamu.

346
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:21,460
Sehemu ya 9: Wanyama Wapendwa / Wanyama Kipenzi: Mbwa na Paka

347
00:21:21,460 --> 00:21:24,037
Tazama hapa.

348
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:28,775
Mbwa yule anavutia sana, sivyo?

349
00:21:28,798 --> 00:21:31,665
Ndiyo, kweli.

350
00:21:31,688 --> 00:21:35,321
Ana mwendo mzuri na ana kimbia vizuri.

351
00:21:35,344 --> 00:21:39,731
Je, unawanyama wa kufugwa?

352
00:21:39,755 --> 00:21:42,055
Ndiyo.

353
00:21:42,078 --> 00:21:46,211
Nyumbani kwangu nina paka wawili.

354
00:21:46,234 --> 00:21:48,807
Sawa.

355
00:21:48,831 --> 00:21:53,364
Unapendelea nani zaidi, mbwa au paka?

356
00:21:53,387 --> 00:21:57,655
Mimi napendelea paka zaidi.

357
00:21:57,679 --> 00:22:00,412
Kwa nini?

358
00:22:00,435 --> 00:22:07,582
Paka ni tulivu. Mbwa ni sauti kidogo.

359
00:22:07,605 --> 00:22:12,272
Mimi napendelea mbwa zaidi ya paka.

360
00:22:12,295 --> 00:22:16,562
Mbwa unaweza kucheza nao, sivyo?

361
00:22:16,585 --> 00:22:18,493
Ndiyo.

362
00:22:18,517 --> 00:22:22,750
Kila asubuhi tunatembea pamoja.

363
00:22:22,773 --> 00:22:26,673
Mbwa wanahitaji kutembea.

364
00:22:26,696 --> 00:22:29,862
Paka hawahitaji kutembea.

365
00:22:29,886 --> 00:22:33,273
Ni nani anayeweza kufugwa kwa urahisi zaidi?

366
00:22:33,296 --> 00:22:37,529
Ninafikiri paka wanafugwa kwa urahisi zaidi.

367
00:22:37,552 --> 00:22:42,220
Mimi nataka kufuga mbwa mkubwa.

368
00:22:42,244 --> 00:22:49,828
Mbwa wakubwa wanakula zaidi kuliko mbwa wadogo.

369
00:22:49,851 --> 00:22:53,830
Gharama ni kubwa.

370
00:22:53,854 --> 00:22:58,687
Kati ya wanyama, unapenda zaidi nani?

371
00:22:58,710 --> 00:23:03,424
Mimi napenda farasi zaidi.

372
00:23:03,447 --> 00:23:05,947
Farasi?

373
00:23:05,970 --> 00:23:09,103
Unaweza kupanda?

374
00:23:09,126 --> 00:23:11,226
Ndiyo.

375
00:23:11,249 --> 00:23:14,719
Nilijifunza utotoni.

376
00:23:14,742 --> 00:23:17,576
Ni kizuri sana!

377
00:23:17,599 --> 00:23:21,499
Mimi napenda sungura.

378
00:23:21,522 --> 00:23:24,630
Sungura pia ni wavutia.

379
00:23:24,654 --> 00:23:26,931
Ndiyo.

380
00:23:26,954 --> 00:23:30,987
Wadogo na wana manyoya laini.

381
00:23:31,010 --> 00:23:35,189
Je, tutaenda bustanini ya wanyama siku hizi?

382
00:23:35,213 --> 00:23:37,754
Sawa.

383
00:23:37,777 --> 00:23:41,610
Nataka kuona wanyama wengi.

384
00:23:41,633 --> 00:23:45,567
Panda ni maarufu zaidi.

385
00:23:45,590 --> 00:23:48,456
Ninapenda kuwaona.

386
00:23:48,479 --> 00:23:51,819
Tuchukue picha nyingi.

387
00:23:51,843 --> 00:23:56,395
Basi, tutaenda Jumapili ya wiki ijayo.

388
00:23:56,418 --> 00:23:58,690
Ndiyo.

389
00:23:58,714 --> 00:24:01,947
Nitapika chakula cha mchana.

390
00:24:01,970 --> 00:24:04,804
Asante.

391
00:24:04,827 --> 00:24:06,327
Sehemu ya 10: Safari ya Likizo ya Kiangazi / Chaguo la Safari ya Likizo ya Kiangazi

392
00:24:06,327 --> 00:24:10,325
Likizo ya kiangazi inakuja hivi karibuni.

393
00:24:10,349 --> 00:24:12,182
Ndiyo.

394
00:24:12,205 --> 00:24:15,838
Je, utaenda safari popote?

395
00:24:15,861 --> 00:24:19,161
Bado sijapanga.

396
00:24:19,184 --> 00:24:21,818
Nina shaka.

397
00:24:21,841 --> 00:24:26,280
Unataka kwenda pwani au milimani?

398
00:24:26,303 --> 00:24:30,499
Mimi napendelea pwani zaidi.

399
00:24:30,523 --> 00:24:33,756
Utakwenda kufanya nini baharini?

400
00:24:33,779 --> 00:24:36,846
Nataka kuogelea.

401
00:24:36,869 --> 00:24:40,805
Kisha, nataka kula samaki.

402
00:24:40,828 --> 00:24:45,585
Napenda milima zaidi ya bahari.

403
00:24:45,609 --> 00:24:48,126
Kwa nini?

404
00:24:48,149 --> 00:24:52,103
Kwa sababu milimani ni baridi zaidi.

405
00:24:52,127 --> 00:24:54,794
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

406
00:24:54,817 --> 00:24:59,350
Bahari wakati wa kiangazi ni moto sana.

407
00:24:59,373 --> 00:25:04,089
Kufanya camping milimani ndiyo furaha kubwa zaidi!

408
00:25:04,112 --> 00:25:06,612
Camping, basi?

409
00:25:06,635 --> 00:25:08,943
Sawa.

410
00:25:08,966 --> 00:25:12,701
Usiku, nyota huwa nzuri sana.

411
00:25:12,725 --> 00:25:17,191
Lakini, kuna wadudu wengi, sivyo?

412
00:25:17,214 --> 00:25:19,348
Ndiyo.

413
00:25:19,371 --> 00:25:24,337
Kati ya bahari na milima, upi una wadudu wengi zaidi?

414
00:25:24,360 --> 00:25:28,294
Nadhani milimani kuna wengi zaidi.

415
00:25:28,317 --> 00:25:31,794
Labda una haki.

416
00:25:31,817 --> 00:25:37,789
Katika safari zako nchini Japani, mahali gani palikuwa bora zaidi?

417
00:25:37,813 --> 00:25:42,880
Hokkaido ilikuwa nzuri zaidi kwa mimi.

418
00:25:42,903 --> 00:25:47,136
Hokkaido chakula chake ni tamu sana!

419
00:25:47,159 --> 00:25:49,493
Ndiyo.

420
00:25:49,515 --> 00:25:52,873
Donburi ya samaki ilikuwa bora kabisa!

421
00:25:52,897 --> 00:25:57,281
Ninapenda kwenda Hokkaido pia.

422
00:25:57,304 --> 00:26:00,204
Ulienda kwa ndege?

423
00:26:00,227 --> 00:26:02,661
Ndiyo.

424
00:26:02,684 --> 00:26:07,265
Ndege ni haraka zaidi kuliko shinkansen.

425
00:26:07,288 --> 00:26:11,430
Ndege inagharimu pesa ngapi hivi?

426
00:26:11,454 --> 00:26:16,320
Wakati wa likizo ya kiangazi, tiketi huwa ghali sana.

427
00:26:16,343 --> 00:26:20,727
Kati ya shinkansen na ndege, gharama ni ipi kubwa zaidi?

428
00:26:20,751 --> 00:26:25,457
Labda ndege ni ghali zaidi.

429
00:26:25,481 --> 00:26:27,781
Nimeelewa.

430
00:26:27,804 --> 00:26:31,147
Nitafikiria kidogo.

431
00:26:31,170 --> 00:26:34,870
Likizo ya kiangazi iwe ya furaha, eh!

432
00:26:34,893 --> 00:26:37,669
Ndiyo. Asante sana.

433
00:26:47,700 --> 00:26:49,200
Sehemu ya 11: Uhamisho na Urahisi wa Apartment Mpya

434
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:53,136
Uhamisho umekuchosha, pole.

435
00:26:53,159 --> 00:26:55,477
Asante.

436
00:26:55,500 --> 00:27:00,167
Mwishowe umepanga mizigo yako?

437
00:27:00,190 --> 00:27:04,490
Ndiyo, jana nilimaliza kila kitu.

438
00:27:04,513 --> 00:27:08,046
Apartment mpya inakuwaje?

439
00:27:08,069 --> 00:27:13,569
Apartment yangu sasa si pana kama ile ya zamani.

440
00:27:13,592 --> 00:27:16,459
Kweli?

441
00:27:16,482 --> 00:27:21,415
Ndiyo, nilitupa vitu vingi visivyohitajika.

442
00:27:21,438 --> 00:27:26,305
Je, ukosefu wa nafasi haukuleta usumbufu?

443
00:27:26,328 --> 00:27:31,661
Hapana. Apartment yangu sasa iko karibu na kituo cha treni zaidi kuliko ile ya zamani.

444
00:27:31,684 --> 00:27:35,517
Unahitaji dakika ngapi kutembea?

445
00:27:35,540 --> 00:27:39,290
Kuhusu dakika tano kwa miguu.

446
00:27:39,314 --> 00:27:42,547
Hiyo ni rahisi sana!

447
00:27:42,570 --> 00:27:48,604
Ndiyo, safari ya kila siku kwenda kazini imekuwa rahisi sana.

448
00:27:48,627 --> 00:27:52,693
Kuna maeneo mengine yaliyoboreshwa?

449
00:27:52,716 --> 00:27:57,707
Dirisha ni kubwa, hivyo chumba kina mwangaza zaidi.

450
00:27:57,731 --> 00:28:01,276
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

451
00:28:01,299 --> 00:28:06,046
Chumba cha zamani kila wakati kilikuwa kizito.

452
00:28:06,070 --> 00:28:09,703
Kuna duka la bidhaa za jumla karibu?

453
00:28:09,726 --> 00:28:14,042
Mbele ya kituo cha treni kuna duka kubwa la bidhaa za jumla.

454
00:28:14,066 --> 00:28:17,966
Ununaji pia ni rahisi, sivyo?

455
00:28:17,989 --> 00:28:23,489
Ndiyo, siku zote naweza kununua mboga freshi.

456
00:28:23,512 --> 00:28:27,645
Kupika kunakuwa furaha zaidi, basi!

457
00:28:27,668 --> 00:28:33,101
Ndiyo. Siku za wikiendi nimeanza kupika chakula changu mwenyewe.

458
00:28:33,124 --> 00:28:38,291
Siku hizi naweza kukujulia katika apartment yako mpya?

459
00:28:38,314 --> 00:28:42,547
Bila shaka, karibu sana.

460
00:28:42,570 --> 00:28:46,712
Nitakununua keki tamu kwa ajili yako.

461
00:28:46,736 --> 00:28:49,519
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

462
00:28:49,542 --> 00:28:53,309
Jumapili ijayo itakuwaje?

463
00:28:53,332 --> 00:28:57,448
Ndiyo, mchana nitapenda.

464
00:28:57,472 --> 00:29:01,150
Nitakupigia simu nikifika kwenye stesheni.

465
00:29:01,173 --> 00:29:02,673
Mandhari 12: Manufaa ya Mazoezi na Jinsi ya Kuendelea Na Yake

466
00:29:02,673 --> 00:29:07,739
Hivi karibuni unafanya mazoezi yoyote?

467
00:29:07,762 --> 00:29:10,911
Sipati hata kidogo.

468
00:29:10,935 --> 00:29:14,471
Inafaa ufanye mazoezi.

469
00:29:14,494 --> 00:29:16,963
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

470
00:29:16,987 --> 00:29:20,738
Hivi karibuni nimeongeza uzito kidogo.

471
00:29:20,761 --> 00:29:26,502
Mimi huwa ninatembea karibu na nyumbani kila siku.

472
00:29:26,526 --> 00:29:28,885
Unatembea?

473
00:29:28,908 --> 00:29:31,146
Ndiyo.

474
00:29:31,170 --> 00:29:35,315
Kila asubuhi ninatembea kwa muda wa nusu saa hivi.

475
00:29:35,339 --> 00:29:39,005
Je, kukimbia si bora zaidi?

476
00:29:39,028 --> 00:29:44,895
Kutembea kuna manufaa sawa na kukimbia.

477
00:29:44,918 --> 00:29:47,784
Kweli?

478
00:29:47,807 --> 00:29:50,592
Sikufahamu.

479
00:29:50,616 --> 00:29:52,250
Ndiyo.

480
00:29:52,273 --> 00:29:56,573
Muhimu ni kutokupita kiasi.

481
00:29:56,596 --> 00:29:59,380
Ndiyo, ni kweli kabisa.

482
00:29:59,403 --> 00:30:05,337
Kutembea kunafaa zaidi kwa muda mrefu kuliko kukimbia.

483
00:30:05,360 --> 00:30:10,072
Kama ni hivyo, labda nitaweza.

484
00:30:10,095 --> 00:30:13,395
Tafadhali anza sasa hivi.

485
00:30:13,418 --> 00:30:16,605
Mwili wako utakuwa mwepesi.

486
00:30:16,629 --> 00:30:20,862
Kutoka kesho asubuhi nitaanza kutembea.

487
00:30:20,885 --> 00:30:24,798
Una viatu vya mazoezi?

488
00:30:24,822 --> 00:30:28,255
Nina viatu vya kawaida tu.

489
00:30:28,278 --> 00:30:32,234
Miguu yako itakuwa inauma.

490
00:30:32,257 --> 00:30:36,010
Inafaa ninunue viatu vya michezo.

491
00:30:36,033 --> 00:30:40,575
Je, utakwenda kununua baada ya kazi leo?

492
00:30:40,599 --> 00:30:42,638
Ndiyo.

493
00:30:42,662 --> 00:30:47,132
Nitafuta viatu vyenye uzito mdogo na rahisi kutembea.

494
00:30:47,155 --> 00:30:51,122
Natumai utaipata viatu vizuri.

495
00:30:51,145 --> 00:30:53,417
Asante.

496
00:30:53,440 --> 00:30:56,506
Kutoka kesho nitajitahidi.

497
00:30:56,529 --> 00:31:00,364
Tujihusishe pamoja ili kuwa wenye afya.

498
00:31:00,388 --> 00:31:06,262
Ukijizoea kutembea, tutaweza kutembea milimani pamoja?

499
00:31:06,286 --> 00:31:08,626
Sawa.

500
00:31:08,649 --> 00:31:11,549
Ninangojea kwa hamu sana.

501
00:31:11,572 --> 00:31:16,105
Kwanza nitazidi kwa mwezi mmoja.

502
00:31:16,128 --> 00:31:19,062
Nakutakia kila la heri.

503
00:31:19,085 --> 00:31:20,585
Mandhari 13: Kutafakari Kuhusu Kubadilisha Simu / Je, Ni Wakati Wa Kubadilisha Simu Yako?

504
00:31:20,585 --> 00:31:26,579
Nina shaka kama nipashe simu yangu mpya.

505
00:31:26,602 --> 00:31:30,702
Simu yako ya sasa ni ya zamani?

506
00:31:30,725 --> 00:31:36,258
Ndiyo, nimeitumia kwa miaka mitatu sasa.

507
00:31:36,281 --> 00:31:43,189
Kwenye mifano mpya, kamera ni bora zaidi kuliko zile za zamani.

508
00:31:43,213 --> 00:31:48,724
Ndiyo, picha zinakuwa nzuri zaidi.

509
00:31:48,748 --> 00:31:53,857
Simu yako ya sasa ina matatizo?

510
00:31:53,880 --> 00:32:01,580
Simu yangu ya sasa siyo rahisi kama mifano mpya.

511
00:32:01,603 --> 00:32:05,752
Battery inakwisha haraka?

512
00:32:05,775 --> 00:32:12,454
Ndiyo, napaswa kuchaji mara mbili kwa siku.

513
00:32:12,478 --> 00:32:16,311
Hiyo ni ngumu sana.

514
00:32:16,334 --> 00:32:24,034
Skrini ni nzuri, picha pia ni nzuri, napenda simu mpya.

515
00:32:24,057 --> 00:32:28,795
Lakini simu mpya ni ghali sana.

516
00:32:28,819 --> 00:32:35,386
Ndiyo, ninafikiri labda itakuwa na bei nafuu kidogo.

517
00:32:35,409 --> 00:32:41,326
Hata na simu unayotumia sasa, haiongi mkazo sana, sie?

518
00:32:41,349 --> 00:32:46,282
Kama ni simu na barua pekee, basi ni sawa.

519
00:32:46,305 --> 00:32:49,172
Unacheza michezo?

520
00:32:49,195 --> 00:32:55,232
Ndiyo, nacheza michezo kwa saa moja kila siku.

521
00:32:55,255 --> 00:33:01,755
Kama ni hivyo, basi ni vizuri ukununue simu yenye uwezo mkubwa.

522
00:33:01,778 --> 00:33:06,612
Ninafikiria kwenda dukani ya umeme wikendi hii kuangalia.

523
00:33:06,634 --> 00:33:10,468
Naweza kuja pamoja nawe?

524
00:33:10,491 --> 00:33:14,424
Ndiyo, karibu tuangalie pamoja.

525
00:33:14,447 --> 00:33:19,992
Simu za hivi karibuni zina rangi nyingi sana, sie?

526
00:33:20,015 --> 00:33:24,549
Mimi nitatafuta simu ya rangi ya buluu.

527
00:33:24,572 --> 00:33:29,356
Tunapaswa kununua kifuniko pia.

528
00:33:29,379 --> 00:33:34,882
Kando ya duka la umeme kuna duka la vitu vya ziada.

529
00:33:34,906 --> 00:33:38,498
Basi, twende huko pia.

530
00:33:38,521 --> 00:33:42,878
Je, alasiri ya Jumamosi wiki hii inakufaa?

531
00:33:42,901 --> 00:33:48,291
Ndiyo, tutakutana mbele ya kituo cha treni.

532
00:33:48,314 --> 00:33:51,624
Asante kwa msaada wako.

533
00:33:51,648 --> 00:33:53,148
Mandhari 14: Mipango ya Safari na Uchaguzi wa Sehemu za Kutembelea

534
00:33:53,148 --> 00:33:58,248
Tujadiliane kuhusu safari ya likizo ndefu.

535
00:33:58,271 --> 00:34:00,465
Sawa.

536
00:34:00,489 --> 00:34:03,756
Tutakwenda wapi?

537
00:34:03,778 --> 00:34:09,212
Unapendelea Kyoto au Osaka?

538
00:34:09,235 --> 00:34:13,868
Mimi napendelea Kyoto zaidi.

539
00:34:13,891 --> 00:34:16,358
Kwa nini?

540
00:34:16,381 --> 00:34:21,314
Ninataka kuona mahekalu na makanisa ya kale.

541
00:34:21,337 --> 00:34:26,104
Mandhari za Kyoto ni nzuri sana, sie?

542
00:34:26,127 --> 00:34:30,960
Ndiyo. Nataka kupiga picha nyingi.

543
00:34:30,983 --> 00:34:35,934
Mimi nataka kula vyakula vyenye ladha nyingi.

544
00:34:35,957 --> 00:34:41,624
Kama utakwenda Osaka, utakula vyakula vizuri.

545
00:34:41,647 --> 00:34:45,965
Takoyaki na okonomiyaki ni maarufu, sie?

546
00:34:45,988 --> 00:34:52,501
Ndiyo. Osaka ni mji wenye shughuli nyingi na ni furaha.

547
00:34:52,525 --> 00:34:58,297
Inachukua muda gani kwa treni kutoka Osaka hadi Kyoto?

548
00:34:58,320 --> 00:35:02,554
Treni inachukua dakika thelathini hivi.

549
00:35:02,577 --> 00:35:06,967
Basi, tunaweza kwenda zote mbili.

550
00:35:06,990 --> 00:35:13,124
Ndiyo. Ni vizuri kuhifadhi hoteli huko Osaka.

551
00:35:13,147 --> 00:35:15,580
Kwa nini?

552
00:35:15,603 --> 00:35:20,903
Unaweza kucheza hadi usiku na ni rahisi pia.

553
00:35:20,926 --> 00:35:24,042
Hiyo ni wazo zuri.

554
00:35:24,066 --> 00:35:30,569
Mchana tutaangalia maeneo ya Kyoto na usiku tutakula chakula huko Osaka.

555
00:35:30,592 --> 00:35:35,382
Ni bora kabisa. Nimechoshwa kuondoka sasa hivi.

556
00:35:35,406 --> 00:35:40,443
Usiku wa leo nitahifadhi hoteli kwa mtandao.

557
00:35:40,466 --> 00:35:45,333
Tafadhali. Nitaigharamia nusu ya gharama.

558
00:35:45,356 --> 00:35:50,554
Nimeelewa. Nitununulia tiketi za Shinkansen pia.

559
00:35:50,577 --> 00:35:55,371
Asante. Nitaanza kuandaa safari.

560
00:35:55,394 --> 00:35:58,364
Ingekuwa vizuri kama itakuwa na jua.

561
00:35:58,388 --> 00:36:01,931
Utanunua nini kama zawadi?

562
00:36:01,955 --> 00:36:06,021
Nina mpango wa kununua wagashi (vyakula vya jadi vya Kijapani).

563
00:36:06,044 --> 00:36:08,911
Nitafanya hivyo pia.

564
00:36:08,935 --> 00:36:10,435
Mandhari 15: Vidokezo vya Kuimarisha Ujapani

565
00:36:10,435 --> 00:36:15,469
Hivi majuzi, masomo ya Kijapani yako yanakuwaje?

566
00:36:15,492 --> 00:36:19,192
Ninajitahidi kila siku.

567
00:36:19,215 --> 00:36:24,148
Kijapani changu kimeimarika kuliko miezi sita iliyopita.

568
00:36:24,171 --> 00:36:26,968
Asante.

569
00:36:26,992 --> 00:36:30,093
Nafurahi sana.

570
00:36:30,116 --> 00:36:34,351
Umefanya mazoezi mengi ya mazungumzo?

571
00:36:34,375 --> 00:36:36,609
Ndiyo.

572
00:36:36,632 --> 00:36:41,265
Ninajaribu kuzungumza na marafiki wa Kijapani.

573
00:36:41,289 --> 00:36:45,555
Hiyo ndiyo mazoezi bora zaidi.

574
00:36:45,578 --> 00:36:51,012
Lakini herufi za Kichina si rahisi kama sarufi.

575
00:36:51,035 --> 00:36:55,604
Kujifunza herufi za Kichina ni vigumu, sivyo?

576
00:36:55,627 --> 00:36:57,984
Ndiyo.

577
00:36:58,008 --> 00:37:03,308
Hata ukijua kusoma, unaweza kusahau haraka.

578
00:37:03,331 --> 00:37:07,565
Inafaa uandike mara nyingi ili uzoee.

579
00:37:07,588 --> 00:37:09,821
Ndiyo.

580
00:37:09,844 --> 00:37:13,818
Nitaandika kwenye daftari kila siku.

581
00:37:13,841 --> 00:37:17,620
Je, unaelewa habari za televisheni?

582
00:37:17,644 --> 00:37:21,024
Bado ni ngumu kidogo.

583
00:37:21,047 --> 00:37:25,435
Ni vizuri uweze kusoma habari haraka.

584
00:37:25,459 --> 00:37:27,592
Ndiyo.

585
00:37:27,615 --> 00:37:31,715
Utaweza kusoma bila kutumia kamusi.

586
00:37:31,738 --> 00:37:36,038
Kutazama anime pia kunasaidia kujifunza.

587
00:37:36,061 --> 00:37:40,961
Je, Kijapani cha anime si kasi kidogo?

588
00:37:40,984 --> 00:37:46,684
Ni kasi, lakini kinasaidia katika mazungumzo ya kila siku.

589
00:37:46,707 --> 00:37:51,304
Wikendi hii nitatazama anime ya Kijapani.

590
00:37:51,328 --> 00:37:55,294
Kuna anime nyingi za kuvutia.

591
00:37:55,317 --> 00:38:00,351
Nitatafuta maneno ambayo sijui mara moja.

592
00:38:00,374 --> 00:38:05,951
Endelea kujifunza kidogo kila siku.

593
00:38:05,974 --> 00:38:08,141
Ndiyo.

594
00:38:08,164 --> 00:38:11,708
Nataka kufaulu mtihani wa msimu wa baridi.

595
00:38:11,732 --> 00:38:15,499
Ni mtihani wa N4, sivyo?

596
00:38:15,522 --> 00:38:18,155
Nakutakia kila la heri.

597
00:38:18,178 --> 00:38:23,511
Kama kuna swali lisilo wazi, nitakuuliza tena.

598
00:38:23,534 --> 00:38:26,128
Hakika.

599
00:38:26,152 --> 00:38:29,219
Tutajifunza pamoja.

600
00:38:29,242 --> 00:38:32,343
Asante kwa msaada wako.

601
00:38:32,367 --> 00:38:33,867
Sehemu ya 16: Faida na Hasara za Kufanya Kazi Kwenye Mtandao

602
00:38:33,867 --> 00:38:38,235
Hivi karibuni unafanya kazi kwa mtandao mara nyingi?

603
00:38:38,258 --> 00:38:43,837
Ndiyo, nafanya kazi nyumbani mara tatu kwa wiki.

604
00:38:43,860 --> 00:38:48,494
Unapendelea nini, kufanya kazi ofisini au kwa mtandao?

605
00:38:48,517 --> 00:38:53,017
Napendelea kufanya kazi kwa mtandao.

606
00:38:53,040 --> 00:38:58,540
Hakuna safari za kwenda kazini, na pia unaweza kulala zaidi asubuhi, ni vizuri.

607
00:38:58,562 --> 00:39:03,503
Ndiyo, treni za asubuhi zinaniumiza sana.

608
00:39:03,527 --> 00:39:08,234
Siku za kwenda ofisini huwa nimechoka mno.

609
00:39:08,258 --> 00:39:13,610
Lakini nyumbani, je, huwa una shida ya kutulia?

610
00:39:13,633 --> 00:39:19,008
Mimi nyumbani ni utulivu zaidi na naweza kutulia.

611
00:39:19,032 --> 00:39:25,098
Nadhani kufanya kazi kwa mtandao si rahisi kama ofisini kwa kujadiliana.

612
00:39:25,121 --> 00:39:30,855
Ofisini unaweza kuuliza mtu karibu haraka.

613
00:39:30,878 --> 00:39:36,511
Ndiyo, kuuliza kwa barua pepe kuhusu jambo lisilo wazi huchukua muda.

614
00:39:36,534 --> 00:39:40,101
Mkutano wa mtandaoni unaendelea aje?

615
00:39:40,124 --> 00:39:45,558
Sauti haisikiki mara kwa mara, na skrini huwa inasimama.

616
00:39:45,581 --> 00:39:50,752
Kwa hiyo, siku za mikutano ni afadhali uende ofisini.

617
00:39:50,776 --> 00:39:56,080
Katika kampuni yangu bado haturuhusiwi kufanya kazi kwa mtandao.

618
00:39:56,103 --> 00:39:58,851
Hiyo ni ngumu sana.

619
00:39:58,875 --> 00:40:01,751
Unafanya kazi ofisini muda wote?

620
00:40:01,774 --> 00:40:07,208
Ndiyo, kila siku naenda kwa treni kwa saa moja.

621
00:40:07,231 --> 00:40:11,864
Kwa nini usijadiliane na mkuu wako kuhusu kufanya kazi kwa mtandao?

622
00:40:11,887 --> 00:40:14,189
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

623
00:40:14,213 --> 00:40:16,846
Mara hii nitajaribu kusema naye.

624
00:40:16,869 --> 00:40:22,342
Siku za kufanya kazi kwa mtandao unaweza kupika chakula cha mchana mwenyewe.

625
00:40:22,366 --> 00:40:26,600
Kama utapunguza kula nje, utatunza pesa pia.

626
00:40:26,623 --> 00:40:30,895
Nimezidi kumnasaa kufanya kazi kwa mtandao.

627
00:40:30,918 --> 00:40:38,551
Mwaka ujao, inawezekana mtindo wa kufanya kazi utabadilika polepole. Natumaini hivyo.

628
00:40:38,574 --> 00:40:42,641
Baada ya kazi leo, tutakwenda kunywa?

629
00:40:42,663 --> 00:40:44,897
Sawa.

630
00:40:44,920 --> 00:40:48,256
Ninapenda kunywa bia tamu.

631
00:40:48,279 --> 00:40:52,013
Twende kwenye mgahawa karibu na kituo cha treni.

632
00:40:52,036 --> 00:40:53,536
Sehemu ya 17: Ulinganisho wa Filamu na Manga

633
00:40:53,536 --> 00:40:59,636
Filamu imemalizika, sivyo?

634
00:40:59,658 --> 00:41:02,492
Ilikuwa ya kusisimua sana na nzuri kabisa!

635
00:41:02,515 --> 00:41:06,615
Vipande vya action vilikuwa vya ajabu, sivyo?

636
00:41:06,638 --> 00:41:10,671
Umesoma komiki ya asili?

637
00:41:10,694 --> 00:41:12,676
Ndiyo.

638
00:41:12,700 --> 00:41:17,255
Filamu haikuwa na maelezo kama komiki.

639
00:41:17,278 --> 00:41:22,011
Kuna baadhi ya sehemu muhimu zilizokosekana.

640
00:41:22,034 --> 00:41:27,567
Wakati ulikuwa saa mbili tu, haina buddi.

641
00:41:27,590 --> 00:41:32,624
Filamu ilikuwa na nguvu zaidi kuliko komiki.

642
00:41:32,647 --> 00:41:38,613
Nimefurahi sana kuiona kwenye skrini kubwa ya sinema.

643
00:41:38,636 --> 00:41:42,803
Inasikitisha zaidi kuliko kuiona kwenye televisheni.

644
00:41:42,827 --> 00:41:47,660
Muziki pia ulikuwa mzuri kama picha.

645
00:41:47,683 --> 00:41:52,155
Sauti za wahusika wapya zilifanana vizuri.

646
00:41:52,179 --> 00:41:56,812
Natamani nione filamu inayofuata kwenye sinema pia.

647
00:41:56,835 --> 00:42:02,215
Inasemekana kuwa filamu ya mwendelezo itatolewa majira ya joto ya mwaka ujao.

648
00:42:02,239 --> 00:42:06,431
Lazima nisubirie mwaka mzima?

649
00:42:06,455 --> 00:42:09,155
Muda mrefu sana!

650
00:42:09,178 --> 00:42:13,734
Nitaisoma tena komiki hadi hapo.

651
00:42:13,757 --> 00:42:18,498
Nami nitaisoma tena kwa mara nyingine.

652
00:42:18,522 --> 00:42:22,904
Ni furaha kubwa kuzungumza maoni na marafiki.

653
00:42:22,928 --> 00:42:24,927
Ndiyo.

654
00:42:24,950 --> 00:42:28,617
Nina njaa.

655
00:42:28,640 --> 00:42:31,913
Je, tutakwenda kula chakula cha jioni?

656
00:42:31,936 --> 00:42:36,456
Ninapenda kula hambaaga au omuraisu.

657
00:42:36,480 --> 00:42:41,437
Kuna mgahawa mzuri wa vyakula vya kizungu kwenye kona hiyo.

658
00:42:41,460 --> 00:42:44,250
Twende huko basi.

659
00:42:44,274 --> 00:42:49,423
Ukionyesha tiketi ya filamu, utapata juisi bure.

660
00:42:49,446 --> 00:42:52,980
Hiyo ni huduma nzuri sana!

661
00:42:53,004 --> 00:42:55,637
Twende basi.

662
00:42:55,660 --> 00:42:59,378
Tuendelee kuzungumza kuhusu filamu.

663
00:42:59,401 --> 00:43:01,268
Ndiyo.

664
00:43:01,291 --> 00:43:04,635
Tuzungumze tulivyoenda.

665
00:43:04,659 --> 00:43:06,159
Sehemu ya 18: Faida za Kupika Nyumbani

666
00:43:06,159 --> 00:43:11,477
Unakula nini kila mchana?

667
00:43:11,500 --> 00:43:18,200
Mimi huwa ninanunua chakula cha mchana kwenye duka la karibu.

668
00:43:18,223 --> 00:43:24,365
Mimi huwa ninabeba chakula nilichokipika mwenyewe.

669
00:43:24,389 --> 00:43:28,255
Unapika mwenyewe?

670
00:43:28,278 --> 00:43:30,812
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

671
00:43:30,835 --> 00:43:36,968
Napenda kupika, kwa hiyo siyo taabu kwangu.

672
00:43:36,991 --> 00:43:42,169
Kati ya kula nje na kupika nyumbani, ni ipi faida zaidi?

673
00:43:42,192 --> 00:43:48,136
Kupika nyumbani ni rahisi na bora kwa afya.

674
00:43:48,160 --> 00:43:53,026
Ninataka pia kukata gharama kidogo.

675
00:43:53,049 --> 00:43:58,632
Kama ni hivyo, basi ni bora kupika nyumbani.

676
00:43:58,656 --> 00:44:03,291
Hivi majuzi mboga zimekuwa ghali, sivyo?

677
00:44:03,314 --> 00:44:10,300
Ndiyo, lakini kula nje huwa haufai kama kupika nyumbani kwa mboga.

678
00:44:10,324 --> 00:44:15,991
Chakula cha mchana cha duka la karibu huwa na mboga kidogo.

679
00:44:16,014 --> 00:44:21,916
Ukikipika mwenyewe, unaweza kula mboga nyingi.

680
00:44:21,939 --> 00:44:28,125
Kupika nyumbani husababisha kuwa na vyombo vingi vya safisha, siyo?

681
00:44:28,148 --> 00:44:34,048
Ni taabu kidogo, lakini ukizoea, hufanya haraka.

682
00:44:34,071 --> 00:44:39,987
Unaweza kupika kwa wingi mwishoni mwa wiki na kuzihifadhi baridi.

683
00:44:40,010 --> 00:44:44,544
Ndiyo. Siku za kazi huwa hazichukui muda mrefu.

684
00:44:44,567 --> 00:44:50,467
Nitajaribu kupika kidogo kuanzia kesho.

685
00:44:50,490 --> 00:44:53,390
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

686
00:44:53,413 --> 00:44:56,166
Utafanya nini?

687
00:44:56,189 --> 00:45:01,723
Nitazaanza na mayai ya kuchemsha ambayo ni rahisi zaidi.

688
00:45:01,746 --> 00:45:04,012
Sawa.

689
00:45:04,035 --> 00:45:07,469
Ni chakula cha asubuhi kitamu sana.

690
00:45:07,492 --> 00:45:12,158
Tunahitaji kununua sufuria na karai.

691
00:45:12,181 --> 00:45:16,766
Tutachague pamoja soko wikiendi hii?

692
00:45:16,790 --> 00:45:19,177
Asante.

693
00:45:19,201 --> 00:45:22,034
Asante kwa msaada wako.

694
00:45:22,057 --> 00:45:28,090
Ukitumia ujuzi wako wa kupika, kila siku utakuwa na furaha.

695
00:45:28,113 --> 00:45:31,813
Ninatamani kuwa mzuri haraka.

696
00:45:31,836 --> 00:45:34,624
Nakutakia kila la heri.

697
00:45:34,648 --> 00:45:37,015
Jitahidi sana.

698
00:45:37,038 --> 00:45:41,671
Ndiyo, nitapika chakula kitamu.

699
00:45:41,694 --> 00:45:43,194
Mstari wa 19: Kulinganisha mavazi ya msimu

700
00:45:43,194 --> 00:45:47,261
Ghafla imekuwa baridi sana, sivyo?

701
00:45:47,284 --> 00:45:53,150
Ndiyo. Inabidi tuanze kutumia mavazi ya baridi.

702
00:45:53,173 --> 00:45:58,355
Unapenda mavazi ya baridi au ya joto?

703
00:45:58,379 --> 00:46:03,545
Mimi napenda baridi zaidi kuliko joto.

704
00:46:03,568 --> 00:46:06,117
Kwa nini?

705
00:46:06,141 --> 00:46:11,853
Wakati wa baridi unaweza kuvaa mavazi mengi kwa mara moja.

706
00:46:11,876 --> 00:46:15,191
Unaweza kufurahia mitindo.

707
00:46:15,215 --> 00:46:20,248
Ndiyo. Koti na skafu pia ni nzuri.

708
00:46:20,271 --> 00:46:27,771
Pia, sipendi joto kwa sababu napata jasho sana.

709
00:46:27,794 --> 00:46:32,927
Mimi napenda mavazi ya joto zaidi kuliko ya baridi kwa sababu ni rahisi.

710
00:46:32,950 --> 00:46:36,508
Mavazi ya joto ni nyepesi.

711
00:46:36,532 --> 00:46:42,232
Ndiyo. Kufua mavazi ya joto pia ni rahisi zaidi.

712
00:46:42,256 --> 00:46:46,689
Sweta za baridi ni vigumu kuzifua.

713
00:46:46,712 --> 00:46:51,045
Mavazi ya baridi yanahitaji gharama ya kufuli kwa dry cleaning.

714
00:46:51,068 --> 00:46:56,426
Koti za baridi ni ghali kama vile buti.

715
00:46:56,450 --> 00:46:58,950
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

716
00:46:58,973 --> 00:47:03,316
Mavazi katika maduka makubwa ni ghali sana.

717
00:47:03,339 --> 00:47:09,439
Mimi ninanunua mavazi ya bei nafuu mtandaoni.

718
00:47:09,462 --> 00:47:13,229
Je, ukubwa wake huwa haupatani?

719
00:47:13,252 --> 00:47:18,603
Mara kwa mara, lakini nasoma maoni kwa makini.

720
00:47:18,626 --> 00:47:22,960
Msimu huu wa baridi utakuwa baridi zaidi.

721
00:47:22,983 --> 00:47:26,959
Ni vizuri kununua mavazi ya kupoza.

722
00:47:26,982 --> 00:47:33,415
Ndiyo. Tunahitaji koti nzito ili tusipate mafua.

723
00:47:33,438 --> 00:47:37,940
Tunapaswa kuwa tayari na skafu na glavu.

724
00:47:37,964 --> 00:47:43,431
Je, tutaenda pamoja kununua wikiendi hii?

725
00:47:43,454 --> 00:47:46,087
Sawa.

726
00:47:46,110 --> 00:47:49,343
Twende kwenye jumba la maduka karibu na kituo cha treni.

727
00:47:49,366 --> 00:47:54,039
Nataka kula ramen moto kwa chakula cha mchana.

728
00:47:54,062 --> 00:47:56,596
Ni tamu sana!

729
00:47:56,619 --> 00:47:59,457
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

730
00:47:59,481 --> 00:48:03,398
Tutafanya bajeti kabla ya kwenda kununua.

731
00:48:03,421 --> 00:48:04,921
Mstari wa 20: Usafiri wa safari ya kazi: Treni ya Shinkansen au ndege?

732
00:48:04,921 --> 00:48:11,655
Umehifadhi tiketi ya safari ya kazi? Nataalamu kati ya Shinkansen na ndege.

733
00:48:11,678 --> 00:48:14,781
Ndege ni haraka zaidi.

734
00:48:14,804 --> 00:48:19,538
Shinkansen siyo haraka kama ndege.

735
00:48:19,561 --> 00:48:25,930
Ndiyo. Lakini Shinkansen ni rahisi zaidi kuliko ndege kwa kupanda.

736
00:48:25,954 --> 00:48:31,220
Haitaji kuweka mizigo au kupitia ukaguzi.

737
00:48:31,243 --> 00:48:36,910
Kwa Shinkansen, unaweza kupanda mara tu unapofika kwenye kituo.

738
00:48:36,933 --> 00:48:41,124
Ni vizuri kwamba haitaji muda wa taratibu.

739
00:48:41,147 --> 00:48:47,380
Kulingana na ndege, Shinkansen ina viti vyenye nafasi zaidi.

740
00:48:47,403 --> 00:48:51,303
Unaweza kufungua kompyuta yako na kufanya kazi.

741
00:48:51,327 --> 00:48:55,914
Ndiyo. Sitaki kupoteza muda wa safari.

742
00:48:55,937 --> 00:48:59,671
Bei ni ghali zaidi upande gani?

743
00:48:59,694 --> 00:49:06,060
Kampuni italipa, lakini Shinkansen ni kidogo rahisi zaidi.

744
00:49:06,083 --> 00:49:11,183
Shinkansen inachukua muda gani hadi Tokyo?

745
00:49:11,206 --> 00:49:14,926
Inachukua takriban saa nne hivi.

746
00:49:14,949 --> 00:49:18,083
Ni ndefu sana, sivyo?

747
00:49:18,106 --> 00:49:20,703
Hauchoki?

748
00:49:20,726 --> 00:49:26,359
Tutakula chakula kitamu cha mchana katikati, basi hakuna tatizo.

749
00:49:26,382 --> 00:49:31,416
Chakula cha stesheni kina aina nyingi na ni furaha kubwa!

750
00:49:31,438 --> 00:49:37,178
Ndiyo. Hiyo ndiyo furaha kubwa zaidi wakati wa safari kwa treni ya Shinkansen.

751
00:49:37,202 --> 00:49:41,591
Mimi napenda mandhari kutoka kwa ndege.

752
00:49:41,615 --> 00:49:46,521
Mandhari juu ya mawingu ni nzuri sana!

753
00:49:46,544 --> 00:49:52,247
Unapoenda mbali, kila mahali panapoenda kuna urahisi tofauti.

754
00:49:52,271 --> 00:49:57,904
Kwa safari hii, kuna stesheni karibu na ofisi yangu, kwa hiyo nimeamua kutumia Shinkansen.

755
00:49:57,927 --> 00:50:02,446
Nitahifadhi kwa mtandao leo mchana.

756
00:50:02,470 --> 00:50:06,205
Ningependa kupata kiti karibu na dirisha.

757
00:50:06,228 --> 00:50:10,961
Ndiyo. Ningependa kuhifadhi kiti ambapo naweza kuona Mlima Fuji.

758
00:50:10,984 --> 00:50:14,417
Safari njema na uwahi kurudi salama.

759
00:50:14,440 --> 00:50:16,611
Asante.

760
00:50:16,635 --> 00:50:19,935
Nitakuletea zawadi.